WEBVTT

02:54.208 --> 02:55.416
Hi, everyone.

05:37.958 --> 05:44.958
FOLLOW MY VOICE

05:50.083 --> 05:56.083
1. GO OUT INTO THE WORLD

06:03.916 --> 06:05.291
Hi

06:05.375 --> 06:08.000
Hi

06:12.875 --> 06:15.250
How are you?

06:18.125 --> 06:20.416
Who is this?

06:20.500 --> 06:21.791
Kang

06:27.083 --> 06:30.958
Kang? From Follow My Voice?

06:32.750 --> 06:33.583
Of course hahaha

06:36.000 --> 06:37.375
How many Kangs do you know?

06:56.500 --> 06:58.666
Sorry for bothering
I love the picture you sent me

06:58.750 --> 07:00.833
I noticed it was signed with a K
Did you paint it?

07:00.916 --> 07:01.750
Yes

07:08.041 --> 07:10.041
That's so cool!

07:10.125 --> 07:13.750
But… Hang on! How do I know it's you?

11:48.500 --> 11:50.666
I'M NOT GOING TO GET BETTER

11:50.750 --> 11:54.958
I'M NEVER GOING TO LEAVE THE HOUSE

11:55.041 --> 12:01.166
I'M ALONE

12:01.250 --> 12:07.125
I CAN'T BREATHE
IT'S A PANIC ATTACK

12:24.916 --> 12:26.583
I'M GOING TO DIE
WHAT HAVE I DONE?

12:26.666 --> 12:28.416
IT'S KANG
HE'S GOING TO KNOW THAT I'M SICK

12:46.041 --> 12:48.041
I CAN'T BREATHE
I'M NOT OKAY

12:48.125 --> 12:50.250
KANG, PLEASE HELP ME

20:53.125 --> 21:00.083
2. BUILD YOUR DAILY LIFE

24:10.250 --> 24:11.333
Hi, Min Seo!

24:14.125 --> 24:15.250
Brother!

24:17.375 --> 24:19.041
Come on, don't get distracted.

24:27.000 --> 24:28.125
You got this wrong.

24:28.833 --> 24:30.208
Dad, we made a mistake!

24:30.291 --> 24:31.125
Let me see.

24:33.041 --> 24:33.916
Well…

24:34.708 --> 24:36.541
Your brother had better help you.

24:37.125 --> 24:40.041
Yeah, I'd better.
This isn't your thing either.

24:56.375 --> 24:58.666
When will you guys stop arguing?

24:58.750 --> 25:00.125
We weren't arguing.

25:00.208 --> 25:01.833
It's always the same.

25:02.875 --> 25:05.250
Don't worry about that.
Let's keep drawing…

25:05.833 --> 25:06.708
Hi, folks!

27:11.708 --> 27:14.041
For… Klara

27:47.416 --> 27:50.875
NEW TALENT
COMPETITION

32:05.041 --> 32:07.666
How was your day?

35:37.833 --> 35:41.333
How was your day?
I'm stuck because of the snow

35:41.416 --> 35:47.708
Where can we see each other alone?

41:38.916 --> 41:45.875
3. DARE TO FEEL

45:27.500 --> 45:32.041
I missed you. Always stay by my side.
Don't leave me.

45:32.125 --> 45:36.208
Hold me. I love you. Tae-ho.

45:40.708 --> 45:42.625
FACETIME VIDEO
KANG

51:23.458 --> 51:26.000
Luckily, we did those tests
after your mother's illness.

51:26.083 --> 51:28.458
There's always a genetic risk.

52:19.958 --> 52:22.083
I'm waiting for you in the car
'Cause it's freezing

52:22.166 --> 52:23.541
It's orange
A little old

52:23.625 --> 52:26.333
I'm sorry

52:38.166 --> 52:40.166
I'm sorry, I had to leave
Another time

52:40.250 --> 52:42.000
Is everything okay?

56:00.583 --> 56:02.583
Dad, am I making too much noise?

56:03.458 --> 56:05.375
No, not at all. I like your song.

56:05.916 --> 56:07.750
I think you're going to win.

56:09.916 --> 56:11.333
Kang, I'm here.

56:12.416 --> 56:15.666
If there's anything
you want to talk about, I'm here for you.

56:18.750 --> 56:19.666
Thanks.

58:03.916 --> 58:06.125
beautiful but sad,
this show today Sigue mi voz

58:06.208 --> 58:07.708
is pretty sad
that's how I ended up

01:14:09.333 --> 01:14:15.333
4. LEARN TO LOVE YOURSELF

01:16:21.916 --> 01:16:28.625
DON'T WORRY…

01:16:28.708 --> 01:16:32.791
THINK ABOUT SOMETHING PRETTY

01:26:38.625 --> 01:26:39.708
Hi, everyone.

01:27:40.750 --> 01:27:44.416
I WILL HAVE A HAPPY ENDING

01:30:30.333 --> 01:30:33.500
I pictured you differently

01:30:35.875 --> 01:30:38.875
But I like you better this way

01:30:41.208 --> 01:30:44.208
With highlights in your hair

01:30:45.000 --> 01:30:49.958
And eyes the color of the sea

01:31:03.208 --> 01:31:06.083
The summers will pass

01:31:08.500 --> 01:31:11.416
We'll grow older

01:31:13.916 --> 01:31:16.791
You'll meet some guy

01:31:17.916 --> 01:31:22.250
He'll write you better songs

01:31:23.166 --> 01:31:27.083
And someday

01:31:28.291 --> 01:31:33.208
I'll be a beautiful memory

01:31:34.333 --> 01:31:37.750
And all that will remain of this love

01:31:39.541 --> 01:31:43.708
Is a whisper in your ear

01:31:46.791 --> 01:31:50.166
If your heart races

01:31:52.041 --> 01:31:55.083
And you look strange in the mirror

01:31:57.708 --> 01:32:04.000
Even if you can't see anything
Follow my voice

01:32:04.083 --> 01:32:07.166
There is no darkness

01:32:07.250 --> 01:32:09.750
That can't be made light

01:32:12.375 --> 01:32:15.333
There is no darkness

01:32:15.416 --> 01:32:20.166
That can't be made light

01:34:37.333 --> 01:34:43.541
5. FOLLOW YOUR VOICE

01:34:43.625 --> 01:34:47.000
5. FOLLOW MY VOICE
